<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n10514" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντίστᾰσ-ις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>counter-faction,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στάσις καὶ ἀ. καὶ μάχη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					560a
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>opposition,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰώνιος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.577
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ τῇ ἀρχῇ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>AJ</u>
					17.11.2
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τύχης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Aem.</u>
					36
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξ ἀ. ἀγωνίζεσθαι</span>”
				<i>in pitched battle,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdn.
					5.4.4
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἴσην ἀ. ἔχειν</span>
			<i>weigh</i> equally, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mu.</u>
				397a1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>counterplea, set-off,</i> e.g. benefit conferred <i>balanced
				against</i> injury done, <i><span class="en">
				Hermog.
				<u>Stat.</u>
				2
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				6
			</span></i> (pl.), Arg.<i><span class="en">
				Lycurg.
			</span></i></div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
